sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant Server

    Browser->>Server: HTTP GET /chat (Upgrade: websocket)
    Server-->>Browser: 101 Switching Protocols
    Note over Browser,Server: WebSocket connection established
    loop Every 30 seconds
        Browser->>Server: ping
        Server-->>Browser: pong
    end
    Browser-xServer: Connection lost
    opt Auto reconnect
        Browser->>Server: Reconnect
    end
